# Auto-push after fixes

When you finish a bugfix, copy tweak, or other working change in this repo:

1. Commit the relevant files with a short why-focused message.
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`main`) immediately.
3. Do not wait for a separate “push” or “commit” message.

Do not force-push. Do not skip hooks. Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials). If push fails, say so and stop.
